Fixed. The bug was in `advanceTurn` at src/sim.ts:43 — the growth check used `foodSurplus >= 0`, so a settlement breaking even (production exactly equals consumption, surplus 0) still gained a person every turn. Changed it to `foodSurplus > 0` so growth only happens on an actual surplus.

Also added regression tests in tests/sim.test.ts covering the three cases: surplus (+1 growth), break-even (no growth), and deficit (no growth).

Verification: `npm run test` — 7/7 passing, and `npm run typecheck` clean.


